---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import OfficialSources from '../../components/OfficialSources.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy for this debt payoff calculator 2026"
  description="Nothing you type ever leaves your browser: here is what is measured, what is not, which cookies exist, and how to exercise the rights you hold over all of it."
>
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto prose prose-lg">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-8">Last updated: July 2025</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        MyDebtPayoff.com is committed to protecting your privacy. This privacy policy explains how we handle
        information when you visit our website. The short version: we collect minimal data and never collect,
        store, or transmit your financial information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Financial Data</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        All debt calculations are performed entirely in your web browser using client-side JavaScript. The debt
        balances, interest rates, payment amounts, and other financial information you enter into our calculator
        are never transmitted to our servers, stored in any database, or shared with any third party. Your
        financial data remains on your device at all times.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Analytics</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        We use Plausible Analytics, a privacy-focused analytics service, to understand how visitors use our
        website. Plausible does not use cookies, does not collect personal data, and is fully compliant with
        GDPR, CCPA, and PECR. The data collected includes page views, referral sources, browser type, and
        general geographic location (country level). No individual visitors can be identified.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        MyDebtPayoff.com does not use cookies for tracking, advertising, or any other purpose. We do not
        use any third-party tracking scripts, advertising networks, or social media pixels.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        The only third-party service we use is Plausible Analytics as described above. We do not use Google
        Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any other tracking service. We do not serve advertisements or use
        advertising networks.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Since we do not collect personal data or financial information, there is no personal data to retain.
        Analytics data is retained in aggregate form by Plausible Analytics in accordance with their privacy
        policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Our website is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect any information
        from children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Under applicable data protection laws including GDPR and CCPA, you have rights regarding your personal
        data. However, since we do not collect personal data, these rights are not applicable in practice. If you
        have any questions or concerns about your privacy, please contact us through the website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an
        updated revision date. Your continued use of the website after any changes constitutes your acceptance of
        the updated policy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <OfficialSources />
</Layout>
